hared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"17Pvr_u1h4EFVV94TZI6ng","review_id":"3tm2VOeuFOhgOZhF3hZQbw","date":"2013-02-15T00:17:11","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9469413757324219,"text_excerpt":"One of my friends kept telling me about this place. One night after the parades I decided to stop in and get some food. I noticed this place is always really busy. Instead of dining in I decided to order my food to go. The lady behind the counter was friendly enough. I will admit that I did have to wait a little while on my food. I didn't mind though considering that there was a really pretty girl flirting with me who was also waiting on her food. I ordered the sweet and sour chicken combo. The sweet and sour chicken was Fantastic! The shrimp fried rice was good. But the best part of the meal was the egg roll. I have been to Chinese restaurants all across the nation but this place has wit..."},{"business_id":"17Pvr_u1h4EFVV94TZI6ng","review_id":"_RH_ZuhzDRwBDYC2ce2JMw","date":"2013-01-16T00:04:40","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9333816766738892,"text_excerpt":"Oh Chinese Kitchen, how i've missed thee. It's literally been since pre-Katrina since i've eaten Chinese Kitchen. My parent's used to order take-out from here so much that i literally had to stop myself from going there once i was of age to drive and make my own decisions on what to eat. However just the other day the urge came rushing back to me for what i remember to be some of the best boneless chicken and combination rice i've eaten. The smell, the taste, everything was a rush of culinary nostalgia! Oh! that boneless chicken, it's so damn good! I remember reports in the past about their 'health conditions' but i'll tell ya what, if a bug or two made it's way into anything i've ever ea..."},{"business_id":"17Pvr_u1h4EFVV94TZI6ng","review_id":"H5_JKoMnZB2V3jQXMrKVzQ","date":"2018-05-27T20:38:01","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9307477474212646,"text_excerpt":"Great place for overstuffed plates and their egg rolls are big and really good. It's not cheap but the food is worth every damn penny. My favorite is the mandarin chicken and combination fried rice"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"17Pvr_u1h4EFVV94TZI6ng","photo_id":"kmrRD-WQYs8-c3zpRIFP5w","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/kmrRD-WQYs8-c3zpRIFP5w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8796697854995728},{"business_id":"17Pvr_u1h4EFVV94TZI6ng","photo_id":"qkxgU_FN-w2G2bSmGBCUWg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/qkxgU_FN-w2G2bSmGBCUWg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8289473056793213},{"business_id":"17Pvr_u1h4EFVV94TZI6ng","photo_id":"M0SqkJMVX9Hzc5P8nvpPzg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/M0SqkJMVX9Hzc5P8nvpPzg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7555897235870361}]},"notebook_case":null}
